#: input:313 standard
msgctxt "europeans_ware"
msgid "It is smelted in a smelting works to retrieve all the metals."
msgstr "Det smälts i ett smältverk för att återvinna alla metaller."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Gold, part 1
#: input:324 standard
msgctxt "ware"
msgid "Gold is the most valuable of all metals, and it is smelted out of ore."
msgstr "Guld är det mest värdefulla av alla metaller och smälts ut ur malm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Gold, part 2
#: input:326 standard
msgctxt "europeans_ware"
msgid ""
"It is produced by the smelting works. Some valuable buildings need gold to "
"be built."
msgstr ""
"Det produceras av smältverk. Vissa värdefulla byggnader behöver guld för att "
"kunna byggas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Quartz
#: input:336 standard
msgctxt "europeans_ware"
msgid ""
"These transparent quartz gems are used for trading. They are produced in a "
"mine."
msgstr ""
"Dessa genomskinliga kvartspärlor används för handel. De produceras i en "
"gruva."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Diamond
#: input:345 standard
msgctxt "europeans_ware"
msgid ""
"These wonderful diamonds are used for trading. They are produced in a mine."
msgstr ""
"Dessa underbara diamanter används för handel. De produceras i en gruva."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Copper Coin
#: input:358 standard
msgctxt "ware"
msgid ""
"Copper coins are money made of copper or bronze (copper and tin). Its the "
"standard barter object."
msgstr ""
"Kopparmynt är pengar gjorda av koppar eller brons (koppar och tenn). Det är "
"det vanligaste bytesobjektet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Silver Coin
#: input:369 standard
msgctxt "ware"
msgid "Silver coins are money made of silver. Its a valuable barter object."
msgstr ""
"Silvermynt är pengar gjorda av silver. Det är ett värdefullt bytesobjekt."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans ware: Gold Coin
#: input:380 standard
msgctxt "ware"
msgid "Gold coins are money made of gold. Its most valuable barter object."
msgstr "Guldmynt är pengar gjorda av guld. Det mest värdefulla bytesobjektet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Carrier
#: input:398 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Used for recruiting all other workers."
msgstr "Används för rekrytering av alla andra arbetstagare."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Carrier
#: input:407 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Carries items along your roads with their hands."
msgstr "Bär föremål längs dina vägar med sina händer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Carrier
#: input:416 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Carries items along your roads with their hands. Only used for busy roads."
msgstr ""
"Bär föremål längs dina vägar med händerna. Används endast för trafikerade "
"vägar."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Carrier
#: input:425 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Carries items along your roads with baskets. Only used for busy roads."
msgstr ""
"Transporterar varor längs dina vägar med korgar. Används endast på "
"trafikerade vägar."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Ox
#: input:434 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Carries items along your roads. They are reared in an animal farm."
msgstr "Transporterar varor längs dina vägar. De föds upp på en djurfarm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Donkey
#: input:443 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Donkeys help to carry items along busy roads. They are reared in an animal "
"farm."
msgstr ""
"Åsnor hjälper till att transportera varor längs trafikerade vägar. De föds "
"upp på en djurfarm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Horse
#: input:452 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Horses help to carry items along busy roads. They are reared in an animal "
"farm."
msgstr ""
"Hästar hjälper till att transportera varor längs trafikerade vägar. De föds "
"upp på en djurfarm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans worker: Tapir
#: input:461 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Tapirs help to carry items along busy roads. They are reared in an animal "
"farm."
msgstr ""
"Tapirer hjälper till att transportera föremål längs trafikerade vägar. De "
"föds upp på en djurfarm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans worker: Reindeer
#: input:470 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Reindeers help to carry items along busy roads. They are reared in an animal "
"farm."
msgstr ""
"Renar hjälper till att transportera varor längs trafikerade vägar. De föds "
"upp på en djurfarm."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Worker
#: input:482 input:491 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "General worker with no special ability."
msgstr "Allmän arbetare utan särskilda färdigheter."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Shipwright
#: input:500 input:509 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Works at the shipyard and constructs new ships."
msgstr "Arbetar på skeppsvarvet och bygger nya skepp."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Ferry
#: input:518 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Ships wares across narrow rivers."
msgstr "Transporterar varor över smala floder."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Builder
#: input:527 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Works at construction sites to raise new buildings."
msgstr "Arbetar på byggarbetsplatser för att uppföra nya byggnader."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Lumberjack / Woodcutter
#: input:539 input:548 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Fells trees."
msgstr "Fäller träd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Ranger / Forester
#: input:557 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Plant trees."
msgstr "Plantera träd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Gardener
#: input:566 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Making clay for lime kiln or stonemasons house and planting reed."
msgstr ""
"Tillverkning av lera för kalkugn eller stenhuggares hus och plantering av "
"vass."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Gardener
#: input:575 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Making clay for lime kiln or stonemasons house and planting reed, cotton and "
"rubber trees."
msgstr ""
"Tillverkning av lera för kalkugnar eller stenhuggares hus och plantering av "
"vass, bomull och gummiträd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for a Europeans worker: Diker
#: input:584 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Constructs breakwaters to gain new land from the sea."
msgstr "Byggar vågbrytare för att vinna ny mark från havet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Geologist
#: input:596 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Discovers resources for mining."
msgstr "Upptäck resurser för gruvdrift."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Stonecutter
#: input:605 input:614 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Cuts blocks of granite and marble out of rocks in the vicinity."
msgstr "Hugger ut block av granit och marmor ur stenblock i närheten."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Miner
#: input:623 input:632 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Mines ore and minerals."
msgstr "Bryter malm och mineraler."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Scout
#: input:644 input:654 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Scouts like Scotty the scout scouting unscouted areas in a scouty fashion."
msgstr "Scouter rekognoserar okända områden."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Scout
#: input:664 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid ""
"Traders work in markets or in trading posts to exchange wares with other "
"tribes."
msgstr ""
"Handlare arbetar på marknader eller handelsstationer för att byta varor med "
"andra stammar."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Recruit
#: input:673 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Eager to become a soldier and defend his tribe!"
msgstr "Ivrig att bli soldat och försvara sin stam!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans worker: Soldier
#: input:682 standard
msgctxt "europeans_worker"
msgid "Defend and Conquer!"
msgstr "Försvara och erövra!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ashes
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Destroyed Building
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ashes
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Destroyed Building
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ashes
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Destroyed Building
#: input:693 input:700 standard
msgid "The remains of a destroyed building."
msgstr "Resterna av en förstörd byggnad."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:707 input:735 input:763 input:791 input:819 input:847 input:875
#: input:903 input:931 standard
msgid "This berry bush has just been planted."
msgstr "Denna bärbuske har just planterats."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:714 input:742 input:770 input:798 input:826 input:854 input:882
#: input:910 input:938 standard
msgid "This berry bush is growing."
msgstr "Denna bärbuske växer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:721 input:749 input:777 input:805 input:833 input:861 input:889
#: input:917 input:945 standard
msgid "This berry bush is flowering. Honey can be produced from it."
msgstr "Denna bärbuske blommar. Honung kan produceras från den."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:728 input:756 input:784 input:812 input:840 input:868 input:896
#: input:924 input:952 standard
msgid "This berry bush is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Denna bärbuske är redo för skörd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:959 standard
msgid "This grapevine has just been planted."
msgstr "Denna vinranka har just planterats."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:966 input:973 standard
msgid "This grapevine is growing."
msgstr "Denna vinranka växer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:980 standard
msgid "This grapevine is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Denna vindruva är redo för skörd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:987 standard
msgid ""
"Ponds with water becomes dry after some time. These dry holes vanish after a "
"while."
msgstr ""
"Dammar med vatten torkar ut efter en tid. Dessa torra hål försvinner efter "
"ett tag."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:994 standard
msgid ""
"When gardeners dig up earth, they leave holes with water in the ground. "
"These falls dry after a while or can be used by terraformer to produce new "
"soil."
msgstr ""
"När trädgårdsmästare gräver upp jorden lämnar de hål med vatten i marken. "
"Dessa fallar torkar efter ett tag eller kan användas av terraformare för att "
"producera ny jord."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1001 standard
msgid "This reed field has just been planted."
msgstr "Detta vassfält har just planterats."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1008 standard
msgid "This reed field is growing."
msgstr "Detta vassfält växer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1015 standard
msgid "This reed field is flowering. Honey can be produced from it."
msgstr "Detta vassfält blommar. Honung kan produceras från det."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1022 standard
msgid "This reed field is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Detta vassfält är klart för skörd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: No resources
#: input:1029 standard
msgid "There are no resources in the ground here."
msgstr "Det finns inga naturresurser här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Water
#: input:1036 standard
msgid "There is water in the ground here that can be pulled up by a well."
msgstr "Det finns vatten i marken här som kan pumpas upp med en brunn."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 1
#: input:1044 input:1088 standard
msgid "Coal veins contain coal that can be dug up by coal mines."
msgstr "Kolfyndigheter innehåller kol som kan brytas i kolgruvor."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1046 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of coal here."
msgstr "Det finns bara lite kol här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 1
#: input:1055 input:1099 standard
msgid "Iron veins contain iron ore that can be dug up by iron mines."
msgstr "Järnådror innehåller järnmalm som kan brytas i järngruvor."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1057 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of iron here."
msgstr "Det finns bara lite järn här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 1
#: input:1066 input:1110 standard
msgid "Gold veins contain gold ore that can be dug up by gold mines."
msgstr "Guldåder innehåller guldmalm som kan brytas i guldgruvor."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1068 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of gold here."
msgstr "Det finns bara lite guld här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 1
#: input:1077 input:1121 standard
msgid ""
"Marble is a basic building material and can be dug up by a marble mine. You "
"will also get granite from the mine."
msgstr ""
"Marmor är ett grundläggande byggmaterial och kan brytas i en marmorgruva. Du "
"får också granit från gruvan."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1079 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of marble here."
msgstr "Det finns bara lite marmor här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1090 standard
msgid "There is a lot of coal here."
msgstr "Det finns mycket kol här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1101 standard
msgid "There is a lot of iron here."
msgstr "Det finns mycket järn här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1112 standard
msgid "There is a lot of gold here."
msgstr "Det finns mycket guld här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1123 standard
msgid "There is a lot of marble here."
msgstr "Det finns mycket marmor här."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ship Under Construction
#: input:1131 standard
msgid "A ship is being constructed at this site."
msgstr "Ett skepp byggs på denna plats."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable usable by Europeans: Dead Tree
#: input:1139 standard
msgid "The remains of an old tree."
msgstr "Resterna av ett gammalt träd."

