#: input:1282 input:1291 input:1300 input:1309 standard
msgctxt "europeans_building"
msgid "The lumberjack’s hut needs trees to fell within the work area."
msgstr "Skogshuggarnas stuga behöver träd att fälla inom arbetsområdet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Europeans production site: Woodcutters House
#: input:1318 standard
msgctxt "europeans_building"
msgid "The lumberjack’s house needs trees to fell within the work area."
msgstr "Skogshuggarnas hus behöver träd som kan fällas inom arbetsområdet."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Europeans production site: Liana Cutter's Hut
#: input:1325 standard
msgctxt "europeans_building"
msgid "Home of the liana cutter who cuts lianas for making ropes."
msgstr "Hem för lianaskäraren som skär lianor för att tillverka rep."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Europeans production site: Liana Cutter's Hut
#: input:1327 standard
msgctxt "europeans_building"
msgid ""
"The liana cutter harvests liana from fully matured trees within the work "
"area which are not being used as lookouts."
msgstr ""
"Lianaskäraren skördar lianor från fullvuxna träd inom arbetsområdet som inte "
"används som utkiksplatser."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Europeans production site: Rare Tree Cutter's Hut
#: input:1334 standard
msgctxt "europeans_building"
msgid ""
"Harvests rare trees in the surrounding area. Delivers ironwood, balsa and "
"rubber."
msgstr ""
"Skördar sällsynta träd i omgivningen. Levererar järnträ, balsaträ och gummi."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Europeans production site: Forester's Hut
#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Europeans production site: Jungle Preserver's Hut
#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Europeans production site: Forester's House
